<title>SINGAPORE: Guthrie announces special dividend.</title>
<headline>Guthrie announces special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guthrie GTS Ltd said on Friday it was proposing a first and final dividend of 2.5 percent and a special dividend of 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>It said the dividends were in view of the company's continued good performance.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
